{"synopsis":"Tokoh utama bereinkarnasi dalam tubuh Kageyama Ayumu karakter latar belakang dari sebuah novel populer\nAyumu memutuskan untuk menyerahkan tugas menyelamatkan dunia kepada tokoh utama asli dan menikmati hidup yang makmur dan bebas tanpa mengganggu alur cerita novel\nNamun ia menemukan diskriminasi terhadap lulusan sekolah nonHunter di sekolah tempat ia bekerja Agar tidak dipandang rendah oleh guruguru lainnya dan agar dapat menjalani hidup yang nyaman Ayumu memulai perjalanan reinkarnasinya bertekad untuk menjadi cukup kuat untuk melindungi dirinya sendiri meskipun itu berarti sedikit mengubah cerita aslinya","alternative_title":"아카데미의 검술 강사가 되었다","author":"coldpig, leejin","artist":"Seong Eun Pyo","chapters":[{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"ba64f00a-fac1-4a92-b035-b8188cc772b4","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-01-28"},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"45e46b2c-8c6f-42b6-ba9f-757eca840424","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-01-21"},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"556d18f4-e3dd-4a26-bfe8-bf6c67af66c5","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-01-14"},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"08d17a5b-567b-4387-b9a6-7bf195e7307f","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2026-01-07"},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"b5e8180d-8fa0-4ebe-aa84-78bd608d5607","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2025-12-31"},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"105e6ade-35d2-4844-81fa-82de1dca5f14","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2025-12-17"},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"19b15acc-d713-47ef-a1ae-83d79e539d8b","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2025-12-11"},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"84280904-5142-45fc-b72c-9f5e619201ee","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2025-12-11"},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"d9fb90d9-d627-466d-a434-111eb7069400","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2025-12-11"},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"6729f50c-4138-40a0-b823-647a5a97edaf","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2025-12-11"},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"33c36374-5c84-4f73-ae57-cc55f444758b","title":"Ch